  "label": "Antisemitic Trope: The State of Israel as a 'Disease' or 'Cancer'",
  "description": "This specific antisemitic trope frames the State of Israel as a malignant entity that spreads harm or corruption globally. It is often used to delegitimize Israel’s existence and justify hostility toward it. The meme’s text directly invokes this trope by labeling Israel as 'the worst cancer I've ever seen', which is a potent and dangerous form of antisemitic rhetoric.",
